{"text": "To Whom It May Concern. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> My name is Marilyn Hark. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And I had a relaxing stay at your hotel. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> During the Krest Hill Autumn Festival last week. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Your facilities were wonderful. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And the staff were very welcoming. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Most importantly. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I had the best sleep in ages. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When I woke up. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I was fully rested. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And my neck did not ache at all. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I believe. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Your hotel pillows were the reason that I could sleep so well. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> So, I am writing to ask. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Where I can purchase pillows like those used at your hotel. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> My hope is. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That with these pillows. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I can sleep as well at home. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> As I did last week at your hotel. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I am looking forward to hearing from you. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Best regards, Marilyn Hark.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "o", " ", "W", "h", "o", "m", " ", "I", "t", " ", "M", "a", "y", " ", "C", "o", "n", "c", "e", "r", "n", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "M", "y", " ", "n", "a", "m", "e", " ", "i", "s", " ", "M", "a", "r", "i", "l", "y", "n", " ", "H", "a", "r", "k", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "A", "n", "d", " ", "I", " ", "h", "a", "d", " ", "a", " ", "r", "e", "l", "a", "x", "i", "n", "g", " ", "s", "t", "a", "y", " ", "a", "t", " ", "y", "o", "u", "r", " ", "h", "o", "t", "e", "l", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "D", "u", "r", "i", "n", "g", " ", "t", "